---
/**
 * @file AiBanner.astro
 * @description Persistent top-right corner badge indicating AI-assisted engineering.
 *
 * POC / Implementation Details:
 * - Positioned permanently at the top-right corner across all pages (public & admin layouts).
 * - Non-dismissible (no close button) with prominent typography and edge status glow.
 * - Why this implementation is best: Clear, unmissable attribution that integrates naturally
 *   into both light and dark theme navigation flows.
 */
---

<aside
  id="ai-banner"
  aria-label="Built with AI badge"
  class="fixed top-3 right-4 z-50 flex items-center gap-2.5 px-4 py-2 rounded-2xl bg-gradient-to-r from-blue-600/10 via-indigo-600/10 to-purple-600/10 dark:from-blue-500/20 dark:via-indigo-500/20 dark:to-purple-500/20 backdrop-blur-xl border border-blue-500/30 dark:border-blue-400/30 shadow-lg text-slate-800 dark:text-slate-100 transition-all duration-300 hover:scale-105"
>
  <div class="relative flex items-center justify-center">
    <span class="absolute inline-flex h-full w-full animate-ping rounded-full bg-blue-400 opacity-75"></span>
    <span class="relative inline-flex h-2.5 w-2.5 rounded-full bg-blue-600 dark:bg-blue-400"></span>
  </div>

  <div class="flex items-center gap-2 font-mono text-xs font-bold tracking-tight">
    <span class="text-transparent bg-clip-text bg-gradient-to-r from-blue-600 to-indigo-600 dark:from-blue-400 dark:to-indigo-300">
      ⚡ BUILT WITH AI
    </span>
  </div>
</aside>
